Adds the four spec §33 release-machinery scripts (release:status,
release:budget, release:prepare, release:check) to package.json's "scripts"
block, placed right after the knowledge:* group they depend on
(mapChangedFilesToFeatures in scripts/release/lib/release-common.mjs reuses
scripts/knowledge/lib/registry.mjs). Deliberately does NOT add release:prod
or deploy:prod — spec §33 is explicit that production mutation stays behind
.github/workflows/production-release.yml and owner approval, never a local
npm script in the routine allowlist.

Apply with: git apply package.json.patch  (from the repo root)
Or by hand: insert the four "release:*" lines below into package.json's
"scripts" block, immediately after "knowledge:report" and before
"baseball:route-coverage".

--- a/package.json
+++ b/package.json
@@ -34,6 +34,10 @@
     "knowledge:context": "node scripts/knowledge/generate-context-pack.mjs",
     "knowledge:check": "node scripts/knowledge/check.mjs",
     "knowledge:report": "node scripts/knowledge/workflow-report.mjs",
+    "release:status": "node scripts/release/status.mjs",
+    "release:budget": "node scripts/release/check-release-budget.mjs",
+    "release:prepare": "node scripts/release/build-release-candidate.mjs",
+    "release:check": "node scripts/release/check-release-candidate.mjs",
     "baseball:route-coverage": "tsx scripts/baseball/generate-route-coverage-report.ts",
     "evals": "promptfoo eval -c evals/round-review.yaml",
     "evals:view": "promptfoo view",
